# Intelligence API - REST Client test file
# Use with the VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client).
# Click "Send Request" above any ### block to execute it.
# Requires the API running locally: make run or docker compose up

@host = http://localhost:8080
@adminKey = test-admin-key
@lookupKey = test-lookup-key
@typosquattingKey = test-typosquatting-key
@enterpriseKey = test-enterprise-key

### Health check (no auth required)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/hello

### App info (admin only)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/info
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Domain lookup (admin key)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}
X-Client-Request-ID: test-admin-001

{
  "domains": ["example.com"]
}

### Domain lookup (lookup key - basic tier)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{lookupKey}}
X-Client-Request-ID: test-lookup-001

{
  "domains": ["example.com", "example.org"]
}

### Domain lookup (enterprise key - premium tier)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{enterpriseKey}}
X-Client-Request-ID: test-enterprise-001

{
  "domains": ["example.com"]
}

### Domain lookup with screenshot (admin key, premium tier)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "screenshot": true
}

### Domain lookup with screenshot - should return 403 (basic tier)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{lookupKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "screenshot": true
}

### Domain lookup with reputation (admin key, premium tier)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "reputation": true
}

### Domain lookup with reputation - should return 403 (basic tier)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{lookupKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "reputation": true
}

### Domain lookup with screenshot + reputation (admin key, premium tier)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "screenshot": true,
  "reputation": true
}

### Domain lookup with email security (lookup key - all tiers)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{lookupKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "email_security": true
}

### Typosquatting - shallow (admin key)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain/typosquatting
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"]
}

### Typosquatting (typosquatting key)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain/typosquatting
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{typosquattingKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"]
}

### Typosquatting - deep with live checks (enterprise key)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain/typosquatting
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{enterpriseKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "depth": "deep",
  "check_live": true
}

### Typosquatting - should return 403 (lookup key lacks typosquatting feature)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain/typosquatting
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{lookupKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"]
}

