### Domain lookup - should return 401 (no key)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "domains": ["example.com"]
}

### Info - should return 403 (lookup key lacks admin feature)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/info
X-API-Key: {{lookupKey}}

### Domain lookup with fingerprint (admin key - all tiers)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "fingerprint": true
}

### Domain lookup with fingerprint (lookup key - all tiers)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{lookupKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "fingerprint": true
}

### Invalidate auth cache (admin only)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/auth/cache/invalidate
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Get fingerprint rules (admin only)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/fingerprints
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Update fingerprint rules (admin only)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/fingerprints
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

[
  {"name":"Nginx","category":"web-server","headers":{"Server":"nginx"}},
  {"name":"PHP","category":"language","headers":{"X-Powered-By":"PHP"},"cookies":["PHPSESSID"]},
  {"name":"Cloudflare","category":"cdn","headers":{"Server":"cloudflare","CF-RAY":""},"cookies":["__cflb"]}
]
